---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="You're In | Redefining Retirement"
  description="Your Gen eXit Playbook is on its way."
  type="website"
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container ty-container">
      <h1 class="ty-headline"><strong>Hell Yeah! You're in, and your playbook is on its way.</strong></h1>
      <p class="ty-subhead">Your <strong>Gen eXit Playbook</strong> is headed to your inbox. While you wait, watch this for a quick message from Corey...</p>

      <div class="video-embed">
        <iframe
          src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/BFklnvKXHg8"
          title="Welcome to Redefining Retirement"
          frameborder="0"
          allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
          allowfullscreen
        ></iframe>
      </div>

      <div class="prose">
        <p>A huge thanks for joining us! Pop over to your email &ndash; I've sent you a quick note with your playbook inside.</p>
        <p>One thing: you'll need to confirm you actually want these emails. You'll get instructions in that first email &ndash; email providers need the thumbs up before they'll let everything through.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose">
        <p>Talk soon,<br />Corey</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .ty-container {
    max-width: 720px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ty-headline {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 2.6rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .ty-subhead {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .ty-container .prose {
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .video-embed {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 56.25%;
    height: 0;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .video-embed iframe {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

</style>
